Well, we brought this up during our live show.

173
00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:27.900
Mm-hmm.

174
00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:32.680
And a woman in the front row had a $100 Canadian bill.

175
00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.200
Yes, she just popped right up.

176
00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.320
She was like, I have one.

177
00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:36.240
Do you want to smell it?

178
00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:37.320
We're like, yes.

179
00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:38.660
So we smelled it.

180
00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.260
Here are the results.

181
00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:48.960
I could smell it.

182
00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:54.700
So I don't know what that is, but we have now smelled a Canadian $100 bill.

183
00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:58.080
Thank you to the woman in the front row for letting us smell your money.

184
00:06:58.320 --> 00:06:58.680
Yes.

185
