I want to know what Sam and Cassie say.

189
00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:10.960
Oh.

190
00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.320
I say syrup.

191
00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:13.540
And I say syrup.

192
